stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NewRequest: 消费者请求进入 /customer/chat
    NewRequest --> CheckPending: 读取 LangGraph checkpoint + Redis HITL TTL
    CheckPending --> InputGuard: 没有 pending
    CheckPending --> CustomerPendingReply: 有 pending
    CustomerPendingReply --> [*]: 告知等待工作人员审核

    [*] --> StaffReview: 售后人员进入 /review/sessions
    StaffReview --> TimeoutPath: Redis TTL 不存在或 expires_at 过期
    StaffReview --> ResumeConfirm: approve
    StaffReview --> ResumeCancel: reject

    InputGuard --> PlanTasks: 业务域与安全检查通过
    PlanTasks --> SelectNextTask: 生成 task_plan
    SelectNextTask --> ExtractSlots: 选择下一个可执行任务
    ExtractSlots --> RetrieveContext: 抽 order_id/category/action_type
    RetrieveContext --> ExecuteReadTask: 只读任务
    ExecuteReadTask --> SelectNextTask: 继续下一个任务
    RetrieveContext --> BuildAfterSalesCase: 副作用任务
    BuildAfterSalesCase --> SelectNextTask: reject / clarify / low-risk execute 已结束
    BuildAfterSalesCase --> AwaitConfirmation: high-risk write 需要 HITL
    AwaitConfirmation --> Interrupted: interrupt() 持久化状态
    Interrupted --> [*]: 返回用户安全话术并生成审核包

    TimeoutPath --> FinalizeEscalation: Command(resume="__hitl_timeout__")
    ResumeConfirm --> FinalizeEscalation: Command(resume="__review_approve__")
    ResumeCancel --> FinalizeEscalation: Command(resume="no")
    FinalizeEscalation --> SelectNextTask: 执行/取消后继续剩余任务
    SelectNextTask --> FinalizeAnswer: 无剩余任务
    FinalizeAnswer --> [*]: 返回最终 answer/sources/trace
